{"4259560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nightmare On Maple Road", "steam_appid": 4259560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmare on Maple Road is a survival horror experience built around constant vulnerability and shared consequences.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must control <strong>two characters trapped in different versions of the same house</strong>, and while you focus on one, the other is left defenseless. One manages dwindling energy. The other mortal wounds. <strong>If either health or energy reaches zero, they are both consumed by the darkness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, item placement, and progression are <strong>randomized each playthrough</strong>, forcing you to adapt under pressure and making every run unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear is not just atmospheric, it affects how you play. As fear rises, simple actions like opening doors become harder to control, turning moments of escape into desperate struggles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the shifting halls of the house, manage limited resources, and use light to survive what stalks you in the dark <strong>before a single mistake seals both their fates.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmare on Maple Road is a survival horror experience built around constant vulnerability and shared consequences.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must control <strong>two characters trapped in different versions of the same house</strong>, and while you focus on one, the other is left defenseless. One manages dwindling energy. The other mortal wounds. <strong>If either health or energy reaches zero, they are both consumed by the darkness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, item placement, and progression are <strong>randomized each playthrough</strong>, forcing you to adapt under pressure and making every run unpredictable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear is not just atmospheric, it affects how you play. As fear rises, simple actions like opening doors become harder to control, turning moments of escape into desperate struggles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the shifting halls of the house, manage limited resources, and use light to survive what stalks you in the dark <strong>before a single mistake seals both their fates.</strong></p>", "short_description": "One house. Two lives. One mistake ends them both. Switch between two teens to survive relentless threats, solve puzzles, and escape the nightmare before its too late.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259560/b57e88f46d9366e844e369551f7c013332bf9417/header.jpg?t=1784157832", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259560/d257433f4928a6bedbfcbf60c8d4efe24200b3b9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784157832", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259560/d257433f4928a6bedbfcbf60c8d4efe24200b3b9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784157832", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD Graphics 620 / GTX 960<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Spellbomb Studios"], "publishers": ["Spellbomb Studios"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 499, "final": 499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$4.99"}, "packages": [1490732], "pa